# C# build output from the golden-vector generator
bin/
obj/

# Development TLS material, generated on first run and cached beside the binary. The 2017
# client needs https and accepts a self-signed certificate; these are per-machine and one of
# them is a private key, so neither belongs in the repository.
skysaga-dev-cert.pem
skysaga-dev-key.pem
skysaga-rsa-cert.pem
skysaga-rsa-key.pem
skysaga-dev-cert.pfx
